agents render — Print the native files apply would write

USAGE
  agents render [options]

OPTIONS
  -file string
    	path to harness-policy.toml or agents.toml
  -harness string
    	target client harness (claude, antigravity, copilot, codex, pi, opencode)
  -os string
    	target operating system (darwin, linux, windows)
  -part string
    	output granularity (permissions, settings, prompt, all)
  -profile string
    	optional configuration profile to apply
  -h, --help
    Show this help and exit.

DEFAULTS
  Prints each target path and the keys agents manages in it; -harness limits the output to one harness.

ENVIRONMENT
  AGENTS_CONFIG: config file; AGENTS_PROFILE: profile; AGENTS_HARNESSES: harnesses; XDG_CONFIG_HOME (Windows APPDATA): config directory.

EXAMPLES
  agents render -harness claude
